listing:   QEMU -object filter-dump (packet capture of the boot NIC)
toolchain: TShark (Wireshark) 4.2.2 (Git v4.2.2 packaged as 4.2.2-1.1build3).
command:   tshark -r dfs_boot_n2.pcap -Y 'dhcp || tftp.opcode == 1 || tftp.opcode == 6'; tshark ... -Y 'tftp.opcode == 3' | wc -l
date:      2026-10-10T00:06:45Z
machine:   Linux x86_64 (cloud build container)
exit code: 0
hardware:  untested on hardware; QEMU 8.2.2 with TCG (no KVM), three emulated PCs on one host, network = labswitch over loopback UDP
